  "details": "Heya. Dont know if this was intentional or not. On the valve index controllers. I always have my hands closed at all times. With \"MM Placement\" ENABLED, If my right-hand ( closed ) passes over and down the menu, nothing happens - GOOD!  When my left hand ( closed ) passes down the menu, it auto grabs and follows  my left hand down.  Personally, because I hold my controllers. Everytime I open the main menu and scroll, then drop my left hand, my menu goes WOOSH -- To the floor. EVERY! TIME!  I wish to know if this is a woopsie or intentional~  THANKS!!!",
